OL,3,GNEWSAWiddecombe suspect accused of
OL,4,Atrying to break into Farage's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man accused of murdering the former
OL,7,FMP Ann Widdecombe in July has appeared
OL,8,Fin court faced with a new allegation of
OL,9,Fpreparing terrorist acts, including
OL,10,Ftrying to break into the home of Reform
OL,11,FUK leader Nigel Farage.
OL,13,FProsecutor Kashif Malik said Joshua
OL,14,FKerry, 28, is alleged to have carried
OL,15,Fout online reconnaissance of "prominent
OL,16,Fpeople and institutions... including
OL,17,Fidentifying the home address of Nigel
OL,18,FFarage".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
