OL,3,GNEWSAWiddecombe suspect accused of
OL,4,Atrying to break into Farage's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prosecutor later told Westminster
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court that damage was
OL,8,Ffound on the doorframe at Farage's home
OL,9,Faddress, adding: "the inference is that
OL,10,Fan attempt was made to gain entry to
OL,11,Fthe house".
OL,13,FKerry was accompanied by four custody
OL,14,Fofficers in the dock and was remanded
OL,15,Fin custody to appear at the Old Bailey
OL,16,Fon Friday.
